- Created: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/scorer/same-owner-ambiguity.vitest.ts` (5 cases: owner pair both orders, two unrelated skills, command row + non-owner skill, third-skill re-tie)
- No change to `fusion.ts` — its inputs allowed the fix inside `ambiguity.ts`.

